sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Pub as Publisher
    participant Cr as Crawler
    participant Proc as Article processor
    participant Clu as Clustering
    participant Idx as Index
    participant Rank as Ranking
    participant U as Reader
    Pub->>Cr: publish article, expose feed
    Cr->>Proc: fetch and extract content
    Proc->>Proc: dedupe near-identical wire copies
    Proc->>Clu: embed and compare to open clusters
    alt matches a running story
        Clu->>Idx: attach to that cluster
    else new story
        Clu->>Idx: open a new cluster
    end
    U->>Rank: open the feed
    Rank->>Idx: candidate clusters
    Rank->>Rank: freshness, authority, personalisation
    Rank-->>U: ranked stories, one card per cluster
